  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Hi guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 5.92,
      "end_time": 6.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey Andy, how you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 7.04,
      "end_time": 9.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Something in my eating cereal right before this and I think it's stuck in my throat.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 9.84,
      "end_time": 13.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So I get that with oats quite a lot.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 17.04,
      "end_time": 18.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Finally every.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 18.72,
      "end_time": 19.36
    },
    {
      "text": "They always, I always get one tiny one in my voice parts.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 21.52,
      "end_time": 24.08
    },
    {
      "text": "With what?",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 26.64,
      "end_time": 27.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Oats.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 27.12,
      "end_time": 27.6
    },
    {
      "text": "With rolled oats.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 27.6,
      "end_time": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that's exactly what I was eating.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 29,
      "end_time": 30.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Annoying.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 34.32,
      "end_time": 34.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I don't know whether Danny's on, but Ahmed definitely isn't.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 36.4,
      "end_time": 40.48
    },
    {
      "text": "He's got a religious thing today.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 40.48,
      "end_time": 44.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Some religious party going on.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 45.76,
      "end_time": 47.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, Danny?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 48.32,
      "end_time": 49.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey Danny.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 49.16,
      "end_time": 49.92
    },
    {
      "text": "You doing your little.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 52.17,
      "end_time": 52.89
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm doing my little, my little de stress skin routine thing.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 54.25,
      "end_time": 57.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, is that a de stress?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 58.01,
      "end_time": 58.97
    },
    {
      "text": "Have you got your little roller as well to keep your wrinkles out?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 58.97,
      "end_time": 61.21
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I don't.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 61.61,
      "end_time": 62.45
    },
    {
      "text": "No I don't.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 62.45,
      "end_time": 63.01
    },
    {
      "text": "But I tell you what I do do when I'm stressed.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 63.01,
      "end_time": 64.89
    },
    {
      "text": "I rub here.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 65.13,
      "end_time": 66.45
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know why I do it, I rub here.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 66.45,
      "end_time": 69.05
    },
    {
      "text": "And you'll know if I'm stressed because I come up with like massive spots on my temples.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 69.29,
      "end_time": 73.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Just FYI, if anyone's ever looking for signs.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 74.09,
      "end_time": 76.89
    },
    {
      "text": "What are you stressed for?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 78.26,
      "end_time": 79.02
    },
    {
      "text": "You look forward to tomorrow.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 79.02,
      "end_time": 80.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Listen, do you see, do you see any?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 80.22,
      "end_time": 81.66
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you see any?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 81.66,
      "end_time": 82.42
    },
    {
      "text": "No you don't?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 82.82,
      "end_time": 83.94
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 83.94,
      "end_time": 84.34
    },
    {
      "text": "They'Re better.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 87.86,
      "end_time": 88.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Nothing after your trip?",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 88.42,
      "end_time": 90.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, it wasn't, it wasn't a trip really.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 91.7,
      "end_time": 93.14
    },
    {
      "text": "It was just a day off.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 93.22,
      "end_time": 94.26
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 94.34,
      "end_time": 94.74
    },
    {
      "text": "So not so normally.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 95.62,
      "end_time": 97.22
    },
    {
      "text": "So my girlfriend, so she works part time, she only works two days a week.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 98.34,
      "end_time": 104.26
    },
    {
      "text": "So the days that she works my mum looks after my little girls.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 104.95,
      "end_time": 109.59
    },
    {
      "text": "But this week she's gone on holiday.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 110.23,
      "end_time": 111.99
    },
    {
      "text": "So yeah, Tuesday and Friday I'm taking off just to look after the girls.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 113.03,
      "end_time": 116.55
    },
    {
      "text": "But it was really good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 116.55,
      "end_time": 117.91
    },
    {
      "text": "It was really good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 117.91,
      "end_time": 118.59
    },
    {
      "text": "It was nice to have like a full day with them actually.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 118.59,
      "end_time": 120.909
    },
    {
      "text": "Like we went to the gym and yeah, it was good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 120.909,
      "end_time": 123.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 126.15,
      "end_time": 126.51
    },
    {
      "text": "So I took them to the gym.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 126.51,
      "end_time": 127.71
    },
    {
      "text": "A one one year old and a two and a bit year old walking out in the gym trying to pick up, pick up weights and stuff.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 127.71,
      "end_time": 134.019
    },
    {
      "text": "It was brilliant.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 134.019,
      "end_time": 134.699
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't ask because my 10 year.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 137.019,
      "end_time": 139.339
    },
    {
      "text": "Old'S desperate to come to the gym with me and I'm.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 139.339,
      "end_time": 141.619
    },
    {
      "text": "I just, I don't, I don't know, I don't know what gym you go to but my gym's like a CrossFit gym.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 141.619,
      "end_time": 146.859
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 149.899,
      "end_time": 150.259
    },
    {
      "text": "Like the commit, like the more commercial gyms.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 150.259,
      "end_time": 152.099
    },
    {
      "text": "Like they're frown upon it but, but yeah, I even take my dog, I take my dog to the gym.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 152.099,
      "end_time": 156.699
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 157.43,
      "end_time": 157.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, we just walk in, we just walk in.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 158.63,
      "end_time": 160.39
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, doctor's potters around sniffing people.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 161.75,
      "end_time": 163.99
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's good, it's nice.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 164.63,
      "end_time": 166.55
    },
    {
      "text": "They're like oh great.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 167.03,
      "end_time": 167.95
    },
    {
      "text": "Danny's here.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 167.95,
      "end_time": 168.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well, well actually what they did say to me a few weeks ago was next time you come in, we'll you put you like, like tie your dog up on the lead like to a pole or something because it molts during summer.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 169.51,
      "end_time": 182.47
    },
    {
      "text": "It's like it was just getting fur everywhere.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 182.74,
      "end_time": 184.58
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 184.66,
      "end_time": 185.06
    },
    {
      "text": "And I was like, yeah, I was like, yeah, fair enough.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 185.06,
      "end_time": 186.98
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, like they're really like CrossFit.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 188.74,
      "end_time": 190.46
    },
    {
      "text": "I was like, that's how CrossFit gyms are.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 190.46,
      "end_time": 191.98
    },
    {
      "text": "They're like community focused.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 191.98,
      "end_time": 193.46
    },
    {
      "text": "So you know, their, their thing is, you know, we don't care.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 193.46,
      "end_time": 196.82
    },
    {
      "text": "We don't care just so long as you make it to the gym.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 197.38,
      "end_time": 199.94
    },
    {
      "text": "If you need to bring your kids, then bring your kids.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 200.1,
      "end_time": 202.34
    },
    {
      "text": "Like some CrossFit gyms have like their own little crash in it as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 202.5,
      "end_time": 206.1
    },
    {
      "text": "So CrossFit's awesome.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 207.38,
      "end_time": 208.66
    },
    {
      "text": "If anybody's looking to get into it.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 208.66,
      "end_time": 210.1
    },
    {
      "text": "I've heard good things about it.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 210.89,
      "end_time": 212.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's really good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 212.57,
      "end_time": 214.09
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's really good.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 214.49,
      "end_time": 215.53
    },
    {
      "text": "Not fair enough for that, Danny.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 215.85,
      "end_time": 217.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Unfortunately, I just like to scare grandpa.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 217.25,
      "end_time": 219.13
    },
    {
      "text": "I know.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 219.69,
      "end_time": 220.25
    },
    {
      "text": "I.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 220.57,
      "end_time": 220.93
    },
    {
      "text": "The first time I ever did CrossFit, I got partnered up.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 220.93,
      "end_time": 224.49
    },
    {
      "text": "I got partnered.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 224.57,
      "end_time": 225.41
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a true story.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 225.41,
      "end_time": 226.17
    },
    {
      "text": "I got partnered up with this 70 year old woman, right?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 226.49,
      "end_time": 229.29
    },
    {
      "text": "She absolutely blasted me.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 229.77,
      "end_time": 232.09
    },
    {
      "text": "Absolutely blasted.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 232.97,
      "end_time": 234.25
    },
    {
      "text": "I, I like collapsed on the floor.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 234.49,
      "end_time": 237.1
    },
    {
      "text": "I like basically blacked out for like five seconds.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 237.1,
      "end_time": 239.62
    },
    {
      "text": "And then I, I got, I got back in my car, demoralized and emotional and I was just like, that's just never going to happen again.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 240.58,
      "end_time": 250.02
    },
    {
      "text": "And then I was like, just like it's a CrossFit.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 250.42,
      "end_time": 252.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Ever since I was like, I'm never having that situation ever again.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 252.5,
      "end_time": 255.06
    },
    {
      "text": "So I've been back.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 255.78,
      "end_time": 256.82
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, for that first one it was just like a real eye opener.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 258.82,
      "end_time": 262.66
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, CrossFit's great.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 263.16,
      "end_time": 264.2
    },
    {
      "text": "That's so funny.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 265.32,
      "end_time": 266.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I, unfortunately I've only got nine minutes until my next meeting because somebody's booked me in and catch past the hour and I don't know why people do that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 267.64,
      "end_time": 274.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So annoying.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 274.2,
      "end_time": 275.08
    },
    {
      "text": "But it's good stuff.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 276.28,
      "end_time": 277.72
    },
    {
      "text": "It's agency a stuff, it's a lead and hopefully we can close it a little bit small, but we'll see.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 277.72,
      "end_time": 283.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So just very quickly.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 284.44,
      "end_time": 286
    },
    {
      "text": "Ahmed isn't on today, so we won't be going through any M and A deals I guess.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 286,
      "end_time": 290.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Amanda, do you have any current issues with Jeff?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 291.17,
      "end_time": 293.73
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the main one really for you.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 293.73,
      "end_time": 295.57
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no, no current issues.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 296.61,
      "end_time": 298.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 299.57,
      "end_time": 299.93
    },
    {
      "text": "The only question I have for today is just if it's okay if I send Gary, just high level overview of those 14 companies.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 299.93,
      "end_time": 306.45
    },
    {
      "text": "You can.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 307.89,
      "end_time": 308.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 308.37,
      "end_time": 309.01
    },
    {
      "text": "Just the Same way that you would do it for Jeff, basically.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 309.01,
      "end_time": 311.57
    },
    {
      "text": "So if he comes back and says yeah, I really like that, that and that then you have to go to each one of those leads and say look, we've come up with a lead with a buyer for you.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 311.65,
      "end_time": 320.46
    },
    {
      "text": "Just need you to confirm that you're okay with us introducing and then give them the name of, of Gary.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 320.46,
      "end_time": 327.58
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not, he's not a buyer though, is.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 328.3,
      "end_time": 329.9
    },
    {
      "text": "He's an M and a advisor.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 329.9,
      "end_time": 331.06
    },
    {
      "text": "So a bit different advisor.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 331.06,
      "end_time": 332.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, just like us.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 332.94,
      "end_time": 334.54
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, all right, that sounds good.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 334.54,
      "end_time": 336.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, but that's, that's on him.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 336.22,
      "end_time": 337.54
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're now giving our leads away.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 337.54,
      "end_time": 339.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Not even.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 339.1,
      "end_time": 339.66
    },
    {
      "text": "But all good.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 342.62,
      "end_time": 343.3
    },
    {
      "text": "I think just on the in this occasionally Gary just try and keep him as white gloved as possible up until his renewal date.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 343.3,
      "end_time": 350.36
    },
    {
      "text": "So his renewal date is coming up soon, I think imminently.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 350.36,
      "end_time": 355.8
    },
    {
      "text": "I want to say 16th, 19th, 19th days.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 356.28,
      "end_time": 360.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Six days.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 361,
      "end_time": 361.56
    },
    {
      "text": "So it'd be nice to add him back into the revenue then.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 361.56,
      "end_time": 365.92
    },
    {
      "text": "You've got Craig shepherd today.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 365.92,
      "end_time": 367.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you do the meeting yet or is that still.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 367.52,
      "end_time": 369.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's say it.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 369.4,
      "end_time": 370.73
    },
    {
      "text": "He actually asked if, if I can meet with him tomorrow at 1pm his time, so.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 370.73,
      "end_time": 375.81
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 376.29,
      "end_time": 377.09
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you going to have Andrea on that call as well?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 377.17,
      "end_time": 379.49
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, Andrea.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 380.29,
      "end_time": 381.93
    },
    {
      "text": "I can invite you to it.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 381.93,
      "end_time": 382.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 383.65,
      "end_time": 384.01
    },
    {
      "text": "And then you can see what kickoff call looks like.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 384.01,
      "end_time": 387.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Andrea, I think going forward it's, it's more likely that you will do those kickoff call onboarding calls and Amanda is going to be more focused on the capital A buy side clients.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 387.73,
      "end_time": 400.6
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 401.8,
      "end_time": 402.2
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a good view to see it.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 402.2,
      "end_time": 403.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Plus I guess going forward, Andrea, we really need to get out from under these 500, 650, 500 pound launch pad clients.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 403.84,
      "end_time": 413.72
    },
    {
      "text": "We just need less of them because they, they take a lot of time and money.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 416.84,
      "end_time": 420.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 420.24,
      "end_time": 420.6
    },
    {
      "text": "But anyway, where are we with those clients?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 420.92,
      "end_time": 423.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me just share my screen.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 423.68,
      "end_time": 425.92
    },
    {
      "text": "I think the easiest.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 425.92,
      "end_time": 427.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone that has been signed up and they'll engine they already have their campaigns.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 429.32,
      "end_time": 435.2
    },
    {
      "text": "I finished the campaigns launching the campaigns yesterday and I have one new client here on the list.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 435.2,
      "end_time": 445
    },
    {
      "text": "Shepherd.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 445,
      "end_time": 445.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, in Cuba or whatever it is.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 449.16,
      "end_time": 451.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Shepherd.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 453.31,
      "end_time": 453.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so we just need to set his campaign up then.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 453.87,
      "end_time": 458.75
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to have yes, the onboarding information.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 459.31,
      "end_time": 462.75
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't have it with Amanda.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 463.15,
      "end_time": 465.59
    },
    {
      "text": "We went through yesterday and she's with, with him.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 465.59,
      "end_time": 470.43
    },
    {
      "text": "I sold him on the new.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 470.51,
      "end_time": 472.11
    },
    {
      "text": "We can play this however you want actually.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 472.75,
      "end_time": 474.27
    },
    {
      "text": "But I sold him on the new structure where they actually build their own deal engine.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 474.27,
      "end_time": 477.79
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't, I don't know if.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 480.44,
      "end_time": 481.44
    },
    {
      "text": "But the only problem is we don't have any Materials to give to him to showcase how to build his own deal engine.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 481.44,
      "end_time": 488.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So we do.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 488.84,
      "end_time": 489.76
    },
    {
      "text": "It's in the school.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 489.76,
      "end_time": 490.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 491.24,
      "end_time": 491.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, that's sweet, though.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 491.56,
      "end_time": 492.52
    },
    {
      "text": "So, you know, in theory, you should be creating his own deal engine and he should just be.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 492.52,
      "end_time": 496.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Where has he moved to and from since you sold him?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 497.4,
      "end_time": 500.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Because we've had him for a while.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 500.08,
      "end_time": 501.16
    },
    {
      "text": "No, we've only had him for a few days, a few weeks, something like that.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 501.96,
      "end_time": 508.12
    },
    {
      "text": "But he went.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 508.12,
      "end_time": 508.6
    },
    {
      "text": "He's been on holiday.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 508.6,
      "end_time": 509.52
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know when he's back, but he's back soon.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 509.52,
      "end_time": 511.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 511.48,
      "end_time": 512.12
    },
    {
      "text": "With Nkubay, though, and I think.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 512.6,
      "end_time": 514.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Sorry, with shepherd, we.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 514.44,
      "end_time": 515.8
    },
    {
      "text": "We need to.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 515.8,
      "end_time": 516.44
    },
    {
      "text": "We need to get.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 516.68,
      "end_time": 517.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe give him a.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 517.36,
      "end_time": 518.28
    },
    {
      "text": "If we give him a kickoff call, it might cause problems.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 519.88,
      "end_time": 522.52
    },
    {
      "text": "What we need to do is just give him.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 522.52,
      "end_time": 524.28
    },
    {
      "text": "What we need to do is just give him an email that onboards where he can log into school and then.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 527.4,
      "end_time": 533.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And then onboard himself.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 533.36,
      "end_time": 534.56
    },
    {
      "text": "All right?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 534.72,
      "end_time": 535.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So if you can email him, Danny, and just say, hey, shepherd, are you back off holiday?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 535.52,
      "end_time": 541.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I just wanted to introduce to the team at Deal Engine so they can.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 541.96,
      "end_time": 545.04
    },
    {
      "text": "They can get you started, helping you set your account up and then all by.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 545.12,
      "end_time": 550.72
    },
    {
      "text": "All by email.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 550.72,
      "end_time": 551.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Andrea.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 551.92,
      "end_time": 552.72
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no, face to face, if possible.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 552.72,
      "end_time": 554.88
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'll take you through those school docs so you can see what it looks like.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 555.77,
      "end_time": 559.69
    },
    {
      "text": "And that should be it.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 561.85,
      "end_time": 562.97
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there anything else that's on fire?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 564.17,
      "end_time": 565.65
    },
    {
      "text": "Because I'm gonna have to hop.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 565.65,
      "end_time": 567.13
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 569.61,
      "end_time": 570.01
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll see you guys in a bit.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 572.65,
      "end_time": 573.93
    },
    {
      "text": "I am available online.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 573.93,
      "end_time": 574.97
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm working all the way up until, God knows, this evening.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 574.97,
      "end_time": 578.01
    },
    {
      "text": "So if you need me, I can hop on calls and talk one to one, but I'm not available for two hours.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 578.01,
      "end_time": 583.13
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 584.4,
      "end_time": 584.8
    },
    {
      "text": "See you later.",
      "speaker_name": "Amanda Sapio",
      "start_time": 587.36,
      "end_time": 588.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 588.04,
      "end_time": 588.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 588.72,
      "end_time": 589.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 589.08,
      "end_time": 589.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrea Poehlmann",
      "start_time": 590.08,
      "end_time": 590.56
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you getting on, Amanda?",
      "speaker_name": "Daniel Smith",
      "start_time": 591.76,
      "end_time": 593.28
    }
